{"summary":"少年侦探团在米花图书馆调查失踪员工与藏毒书籍，案件涉及电梯和无书脊伪书的异常线索。","sources":["src-detective-conan-world-library-case"],"relatedEpisodes":["episode-0050"],"culprit":{"zhHans":"津川秀治。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"motive":{"zhHans":"津川在米花图书馆的无书脊伪书中藏匿毒品并逐批出售；馆长玉田发现了毒品，因此津川为灭口杀害玉田。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"method":{"zhHans":"津川杀害玉田后，将尸体从电梯井抛下并藏在电梯箱顶部；同时把藏毒的无书脊伪书排成儿童区的第三排，制造书架排列异常。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"evidence":{"zhHans":"电梯在载荷看似不足时触发超重警报，提示电梯箱顶部有尸体；儿童区书架出现由无书脊伪书形成的第三排，且书籍排列不齐；书中藏有毒品。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"resolution":{"zhHans":"柯南根据电梯超重警报、尸体位置和藏毒伪书的排列机关识破案件，津川作为犯人被揭发。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"deepSpoilers":true,"detailStatus":"deepSpoilers","updatedAt":"2026-10-27","dcwPage":"Library_Murder_Case","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Detective Boys","Kogoro Mouri","Ran Mouri","Juzo Megure","Wataru Takagi","Hiroshi Agasa","Shinichi Kudo"],"solvedBy":"Conan Edogawa","dcwAirDate":"March 3, 1997","dcwMangaCaseNumber":"#26","locations":["Beika Library"],"locationsSource":"Library_Murder_Case","locationsDropped":["Beika Library Elevator","Beika Library (unknown specific location)"],"victims":[{"name":"Ayumi Yoshida","nameZh":"吉田步美"}],"caseFactsSource":"Library_Murder_Case","locationsZh":["米花图书馆"]}